WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.300 --> 00:00:02.182
Kervaire's conjecture, and Howie's.

2
00:00:02.800 --> 00:00:05.114
Can one new generator and one relation

3
00:00:05.114 --> 00:00:07.428
kill a nontrivial group? Kervaire said no.

4
00:00:08.800 --> 00:00:10.845
A dying element would give a planar

5
00:00:10.845 --> 00:00:12.597
